    "date_str": "2026-02-11",
    "description": "Kivul Oya Reservoir project has dubious economic benefits, serious environmental costs and the potential to reignite ethnic  tensions : JVP led NPP Govt would be wise to pause and reconsider Instead of Falling Into a Political Trap.",
    "url_metadata": "https://dbsjeyaraj.com/dbsj/?p=87008",
