    "chunk_text": "Professor Dale Pinto visits H Connect International, reinforces focus on future-ready accounting talent\n\nH Connect International (A Hirdaramani Group Venture), a leading global Business Process Management (BPM) and Outsourcing company, was honoured to welcome Professor Dale Pinto FCPA, President and Chair of the Board of CPA Australia, for an official visit. He was accompanied by the CPA Australia delegation Jatin Sharma \u2013 Regional Manager, Middle East & South Asia, Don Poh \u2013 Business Development Manager \u2013 Emerging Markets, Global Growth Strategy, and Pramudi Nanayakkara \u2013 Business Development Manager \u2013 Sri Lanka Liaison.\n\nThe visit marks a significant milestone in H Connect International\u2019s strategic partnership with CPA Australia, reflecting the company\u2019s position as the first CPA Australia Recognized Employer Partner (REP) in Sri Lanka. The alliance is designed to support professional development and cultivate a workforce capable of meeting global standards in finance, accounting and operational services.\n\nFirst bank in Sri Lanka to enable Google Pay for Mastercard cardholders\n\nTokyo Cement\u2019s FY25/26 Q3 financial results \u2018position group for industry upswing\u2019\n\nLeave a Reply Cancel replyYour email address will not be published. Required fields are marked *Comment * Name *\n\nSave my name, email, and website in this browser for the next time I comment."
