    "description": "Rebuilding Sri Lanka\u2019s Farming After Cyclone Ditwah: A Reform Agenda, Not A Repair Job",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.colombotelegraph.com/index.php/rebuilding-sri-lankas-farming-after-cyclone-ditwah-a-reform-agenda-not-a-repair-job/",
