    "description": "Sinopec extends Clean Sri Lanka network with new look stations across Anuradhapura",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/business/Sinopec-extends-Clean-Sri-Lanka-network-with-new-look-stations-across-Anuradhapura/34-788291",
    "lang": "en",
