    "description": "Is Sri Lanka entering a \u2018disaster inequality trap\u2019 after Cyclone Ditwah?",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/columns/Is-Sri-Lanka-entering-a-disaster-inequality-trap-after-Cyclone-Ditwah/4-788311",
    "lang": "en",
