    "chunk_text": "I am writing this as someone who has supported and believed in the National People\u2019s Power and the Janatha Vimukthi Peramuna all my adult life. I am writing as someone who believed that the election victory of the National People\u2019s Power and your presidential election victory in 2024 were victories for the people. I am writing to you today particularly as a woman and as a scholar of Buddhism."
