    "description": "Keells Nexus introduces an all new Loyalty App, marking a new era of connected, everyday rewards",
    "url_metadata": "http://island.lk/keells-nexus-introduces-an-all-new-loyalty-app-marking-a-new-era-of-connected-everyday-rewards/",
    "lang": "en",
