    "description": "\u2018With AI around, hardly anyone does any real work,\u2019 says university don",
    "url_metadata": "http://island.lk/with-ai-around-hardly-anyone-does-any-real-work-says-university-don/",
    "lang": "en",
    "newspaper_id": "islandlk",
    "time_ut": 1771160760.0,
    "chunk_id": "2026-02-15-islandlk-c0b039c4-0000",
    "chunk_index": 0,
