    "md5": "2777a135acf653f289a7dabba8ee3ce3",
    "chunk_size_bytes": 1552,
    "chunk_text": "Sun Siyam Group promotes Deepak Booneady to GCEO\n\nSun Siyam Group, a leading privately-owned hospitality group in the Indian Ocean, has announced the promotion of Deepak Booneady to Group Chief Executive Officer.\n\nBooneady previously served as CEO of Sun Siyam Resorts, where he played a pivotal role in strengthening brand positioning, enhancing guest experiences and advancing strategic initiatives across the group\u2019s portfolio in the Maldives and Sri Lanka.\n\nIn his new role, he will oversee strategic growth, long-term brand development and expansion into new concepts and markets, while ensuring alignment with the group\u2019s founding values of authenticity and heartfelt hospitality.\n\nChairman and Managing Director Ahmed Siyam Mohamed commented: \u201cDeepak has been an important part of our journey, and his leadership has contributed meaningfully to many of the milestones we have achieved together. He leads with strategic clarity, integrity and genuine respect for our people and culture.\u201d\n\nFounded more than three decades ago, Sun Siyam Group operates resorts across its Luxury, Priv\u00e9 and Lifestyle collections, supported by global sales offices in Europe, Asia Pacific, the Middle East and the Americas.\n\nMegha Nadha unveils \u2018new concept\u2019 for live music in Sri Lanka\n\nLanka Hospitals makes history with third consecutive Gold at TAGS Awards\n\nLeave a Reply Cancel replyYour email address will not be published. Required fields are marked *Comment * Name *\n\nSave my name, email, and website in this browser for the next time I comment."
