    "description": "India AI Impact Summit: Global South\u2019s AI moment and a shared future with Sri Lanka",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/columns/India-AI-Impact-Summit-Global-South-s-AI-moment-and-a-shared-future-with-Sri-Lanka/4-788378",
