    "description": "Key insights to \u201cBuilding Back Better\u201d after Cyclone Ditwah at OPA forum",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/news/Key-insights-to-Building-Back-Better-after-Cyclone-Ditwah-at-OPA-forum/56-788393",
