    "chunk_text": "Hayleys Mobility unveils South Asia\u2019s largest OMODA & JAECOO showroom, elevating premium new-energy vehicle experiences in Colombo\n\nHayleys Mobility Limited has announced the opening of South Asia\u2019s largest OMODA & JAECOO (OJ) showroom flagship showroom at No. 127/1, Sir James Pieris Mawatha, Colombo 2.\n\nThe landmark facility marks a major milestone in transforming how Sri Lankans discover, experience and transition to premium, sustainable mobility solutions, reflecting Sri Lanka\u2019s significant advancement in the region\u2019s automotive landscape.\n\nAs the exclusive authorised distributor of OJ in Sri Lanka, Hayleys Mobility continues to accelerate the country\u2019s transition towards a smarter, cleaner, and future-ready transportation ecosystem. Backed by a strategic partnership with the Chery Group, the company caters to diverse mobility needs and delivers next-generation vehicles complemented by robust charging infrastructure, aligned with its brand promise, \u201cOne Brand for Every Journey\u201d.\n\nDedicated exclusively to the OJ portfolio, the flagship OJ showroom presents a curated portfolio of premium electric, plug-in hybrid and ICE vehicles. Customers can view and explore models such as the JAECOO J8, J7 PHEV, J6 and J5, alongside the OMODA C9 PHEV, C5 and E5.\n\n\u2018With AI around, hardly anyone does any real work,\u2019 says university don\n\nLeave a Reply Cancel replyYour email address will not be published. Required fields are marked *Comment * Name *\n\nSave my name, email, and website in this browser for the next time I comment."
