    "chunk_text": "This partnership also strengthens WIDAC\u2019s ability to support a wide range of local stakeholders, from educational institutions and healthcare providers to developers, consultants, and contractors, by offering flooring systems that align with international benchmarks while being adapted to local conditions.\n\nBeyond products, the collaboration represents a shared philosophy: delivering solutions that perform consistently over time, reduce maintenance challenges, and support the people who use these spaces every day. With WIDAC\u2019s deep understanding of the Sri Lankan market and Gerflor\u2019s global innovation, the partnership is positioned to raise the standard for specialised flooring solutions in the country.\n\nAs Sri Lanka continues to invest in sports, healthcare, and public infrastructure, the WIDAC\u2013Gerflor partnership brings together global expertise and local execution, setting a new benchmark for quality, safety, and performance in commercial flooring. Gerflor\u2019s flooring solutions are now available for viewing at the WIDAC Experience Centre - No. 36, Dudley Senanayake Mawatha, Colombo 8, allowing clients to experience their performance and finishes firsthand."
