    "date_str": "2026-02-17",
    "description": "Why the IMF agenda in Sri Lanka must be people-centred",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/columns/Why-the-IMF-agenda-in-Sri-Lanka-must-be-people-centred/4-788426",
    "lang": "en",
