    "description": "Celebration of 78th anniversary of Independence of Sri Lanka in Brasilia",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/news/Celebration-of-78th-anniversary-of-Independence-of-Sri-Lanka-in-Brasilia/56-788452",
    "lang": "en",
