    "chunk_text": "Someone has posed a question whether it is justifiable that the costs of incarceration of crooks at State expenses is fair. It has often been mentioned that essential public needs like garbage collection and tank desilting cannot be done due to lack of money. How about deploying cheats, thieves. murderers and guilty politicians to offset their lodging costs by bartering labour for shelter?"
  },
