    "chunk_text": "However, the rapid expansion of AI brings challenges, including concerns about data privacy, algorithmic bias, and potential job displacement. Policymakers and industry leaders are therefore emphasising responsible AI development, focusing on ethical frameworks and inclusive growth.\n\nThrough strategic investment, global partnerships, and a commitment to people-centric innovation, India is positioning itself not only as a technology leader but also as a champion of responsible and inclusive AI development for the world."
