    "chunk_size_bytes": 1492,
    "chunk_text": "Bitumix celebrates 25 years of industry leadership and resilience\n\nBitumix Ltd., Sri Lanka\u2019s flagship bitumen company, marks its 25th anniversary, celebrating a journey defined by vision, resilience, and contribution to national infrastructure development.\n\nFounded in 2001 by Chairman Ashoka Siriwardena, Bitumix began as a bold entrepreneurial venture with a clear ambition\u2014to build a sustainable enterprise within Sri Lanka\u2019s road construction materials sector. From modest beginnings, the company has grown into a trusted industry leader, supporting major infrastructure projects across the island and earning the confidence of stakeholders throughout the value chain.\n\nOver the past two and a half decades, Bitumix has navigated global price volatility, economic downturns, exchange rate pressures, legal complexities, and intense market competition. Each challenge tested the organisation\u2019s strength, yet reinforced its determination to adapt, innovate, and grow. Through disciplined leadership and a commitment to quality and integrity, the company has consistently upheld high service standards while strengthening long-term partnerships.\n\nReflecting on the milestone, Siriwardena noted that reaching 25 years represents not just longevity, but perseverance and shared purpose. He acknowledged the dedication of employees, the loyalty of customers, and the support of suppliers, financiers, regulators, and well-wishers who have contributed to the company\u2019s steady progress."
  },
