    "chunk_size_bytes": 1889,
    "chunk_text": "HNB becomes Official Banking Partner of the Royal\u2013Thomian\n\nHNB PLC, Sri Lanka\u2019s leading private sector bank, has come on board for the first time as the Official Banking Partner of the 147th edition of the iconic \u201cBattle of the Blues\u201d, the historic Royal\u2013Thomian cricket encounter between Royal College, Colombo and S. Thomas\u2019 College, Mt. Lavinia.\n\nCommenting on the partnership, HNB\u2019s Managing Director / CEO, Damith Pallewatte stated, \u201cAt HNB, we are honored to mark our inaugural partnership with the Battle of the Blues, one of Sri Lanka\u2019s most celebrated school cricketing traditions. HNB indeed has as a great connection with Cricket as the sponsor of 1st Test Cricket match played Sri Lanka Vs. England 1982. Our support for school cricket highlights a deep commitment to nurturing young talent and inspiring a lifelong passion for the game. Through flagship initiatives such as the Battle of the Blues, we aim to empower the next generation of cricketing communities, while preserving the rich heritage and spirit of Sri Lankan school cricket.\u201d\n\nThe three-day encounter for the Rt. Hon. D. S. Senanayake Memorial Shield will be played from March 12 to 14 at the SSC Grounds, Colombo. Recognised as the second-longest uninterrupted school cricket series in the world, the Royal\u2013Thomian stands as a living testament to tradition, sportsmanship, and brotherhood. The Mustangs Trophy one-day encounter will follow on March 28 under lights at the SSC, adding modern energy to this timeless contest.\n\nHNB\u2019s partnership with the Royal\u2013Thomian represents a significant milestone in the Bank\u2019s sports marketing journey. Aligning for the first time with Sri Lanka\u2019s most iconic \u201cBig Match,\u201d HNB strengthens its footprint within the school cricketing ecosystem a platform that has produced generations of national heroes and global ambassadors for the game."
