    "description": "The \u2019\u2019Silent Bottleneck\u2019\u2019 in 2026 education reforms",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/columns/The-Silent-Bottleneck-in-2026-education-reforms/4-788577",
    "lang": "en",
    "newspaper_id": "dailyftlk",
