    "description": "Rahman\u2019s post-election Bangladesh and Hasina\u2019s Awami League",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/columns/Rahman-s-post-election-Bangladesh-and-Hasina-s-Awami-League/4-788631",
