    "description": "Speaker names PSC to rework Provincial Council poll system",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/news/Speaker-names-PSC-to-rework-Provincial-Council-poll-system/56-788650",
    "lang": "en",
    "newspaper_id": "dailyftlk",
