    "chunk_text": "Fcode Labs invests in German coffee startup Bunamo\n\nFcode Labs, the global product innovation and engineering company, has made a strategic investment in Bunamo, a Germany-based startup building a digital platform for the coffee community.\n\nAlongside the investment, Fcode Labs partnered with Bunamo to design and engineer a scalable, production-ready platform. The goal is to create a connected experience that brings together home baristas, professional roasters, and coffee brands through content-driven interactions like recipe sharing.\n\nFounded by Dr. Torben Gr\u00e4ber and Phill Kopp, Bunamo serves as a dedicated space for coffee lovers to explore brewing methods and discover new roasters.\n\n\u201cOur decision to invest was driven by the passion of the team and we see a fast-growing coffee community not only across Europe but also in the rest of the world,\u201d said Buddhishan Manamperi, Co-CEO of Fcode Labs.\n\nFcode Labs built the platform with a user-centered design and a scalable, cloud-ready architecture to support future expansion. The collaboration highlights Fcode\u2019s model of combining capital with deep technical expertise to help founders turn ideas into scalable digital platforms.\n\nComBank\u2019s \u2018Pita Rata Wasi\u2019 remittance promo back with Rs. 6 million in cash prizes\n\nLeave a Reply Cancel replyYour email address will not be published. Required fields are marked *Comment * Name *\n\nSave my name, email, and website in this browser for the next time I comment."
