    "chunk_size_bytes": 657,
    "chunk_text": "Melstacorp divests 0.04% DCSL stake for Rs. 119 m\n\nMelstacorp PLC has divested 2 million shares amounting to a 0.04% stake in Distilleries Company of Sri Lanka PLC (DCSL) on 19 February.\n\nThe divestment was made at a price of Rs. 59.50 per share, giving Melstacorp Rs. 119 million from the sale.\n\nFollowing the transaction, Melstacorp\u2019s shareholding in DCSL decreased marginally from 92.44% to 92.40% with over 4 billion shares. Distilleries ended Friday down Rs. 0.30 at Rs. 59 and Melstacorp was down Rs. 1.75 to Rs. 181.25.\n\nMelstacorp reported Rs. 131.99 in assets per share as of end-December 2025, and DCSL reported net assets of Rs. 4.14 per share."
  },
