    "description": "OMICRON launches CPX 200 ecosystem in Colombo, strengthening commitment to Sri Lanka\u2019s power sector",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/business/OMICRON-launches-CPX-200-ecosystem-in-Colombo-strengthening-commitment-to-Sri-Lanka-s-power-sector/34-788681",
    "lang": "en",
