    "chunk_text": "Meanwhile  a  romance blossomed. Seetha Ediriweera from Devinuuwara who bore the nom de guerre Sujatha was moved to the Kalutara district by the JVP high command and appointed as   full time activist in charge of the District\u2019s women\u2019s league. Gradually  both  \u201cSusil and Sujatha\u201d fell in love. The happy couple planned to marry in October 1987 when the unexpected happened in September.\n\nThis article  appears in the \u201cDBS Jeyaraj Column\u201dof the \u201cDaily Mirror\u201ddated 23rd February 2026.It  can be accessed here \u2013"
