    "chunk_size_bytes": 1014,
    "chunk_text": "London scene for Rajiv\n\nRajiv Sebastian is billed to perform in London, at \u2018Funky Bash 70s\u2019, a dinner dance organised by the UK Old Girls Association of Ananda Balika Vidyalaya.\n\nIt will be held at the Double Tree by Hilton, on 28th February, and Rajiv says he is eagerly looking forward to this prestigious event.\n\nHe will have for company the UK-based band Hasthi who will provide the music for Rajiv to move into action.\n\nRajiv also mentioned that he was involved in Corrine Almeida\u2019s latest release \u2018Valentine\u2019 (\u2018Malsara\u2018), created for Valentine\u2019s Day, and which is now available on YouTube, Spotify and other digital platforms.\n\nRajiv, in fact, was also responsible for Corrine\u2019s big hit  \u2018Mage Konde Nethath.\u2019\n\nGuardians of the silent kingdom: Sri Lanka\u2019s wild soul and urgency of protection\n\nLeave a Reply Cancel replyYour email address will not be published. Required fields are marked *Comment * Name *\n\nSave my name, email, and website in this browser for the next time I comment."
