    "description": "\u201cI would have welcomed the opportunity to engage directly with critics, including those who strongly oppose my views, because meaningful reconciliation and progress can only emerge when differing perspectives meet in open conversation.\u201d says Namal Rajapaksa MP after Cancellation of Oxford and Cambridge University Events",
    "url_metadata": "https://dbsjeyaraj.com/dbsj/?p=87112",
