    "md5": "6cfca54577f69a21a4338271680c651e",
    "chunk_size_bytes": 1385,
    "chunk_text": "Colombo Dockyard announces Board appointments post-Mazagon takeover\n\nPost-acquisition of a majority stake, Mazagon Dock Shipbuilders have announced appointments to the Colombo Dockyard PLC Board.\n\nCapt. (Retd.) Jagmohan, Biju George and Ruchir Agrawal have been appointed to the Colombo Dockyard Board as Non-Executive/Non-Independent Directors.\n\nCapt. (Retd.) Jagmohan serves as Chairman and Managing Director of the Mazagon Dock Shipbuilders Ltd. (MDL). He is a Naval Architect from Cochin University of Science and Technology. He has also done post-graduation and M. Tech in Naval Construction and Ocean Engineering from IIT Delhi and IIT Kharagpur, respectively. He served for over 25 years in the Indian Navy during which he held several important assignments in the Directorate of Naval Design and at Naval Dockyard, Mumbai. Prior to joining MDL, he was Director (Corporate Planning, Project and Business Development) and Director (Operations) - Addl. Charge at Goa Shipyard Ltd. He also worked with Garden Reach Shipbuilders and\u00a0 Engineers Ltd. (GRSE), Kolkata as Chief General Manager (Design). As Head of Design at GRSE, he was responsible for the execution and management of design of various complex warship projects such as Advanced Stealth Frigate, P28 ASW Corvette, Survey Vessel, ASW Shallow Water Craft and Fast Patrol Vessels for the Indian Navy & Indian Coast Guard."
  },
