    "description": "SJB must be more of a guardrail than a roadblock",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/columns/SJB-must-be-more-of-a-guardrail-than-a-roadblock/4-788831",
    "lang": "en",
    "newspaper_id": "dailyftlk",
