    "md5": "67d22bf1cfac4c9b7890a41c92826bd5",
    "chunk_size_bytes": 2009,
    "chunk_text": "Prime Lands secures historic Otters Club car park property for \u2018The Elizabeth\u2019 residential tower\n\nPrime Lands Residencies PLC Group Chairman/Executive Director Premalal Brahmanage (right) and UDA Chairman M.G. Hemachandra at the signing of the agreement for the acquisition of the Otters Club car park property in Colombo 07\n\nPrime Lands Residencies PLC has secured the historic Otters Club car park property in Colombo 7 through a recently concluded agreement with the Urban Development Authority (UDA), marking one of the most significant residential land acquisitions in the district in recent years.\n\nThe property will be developed into \u2018The Elizabeth\u2019, a landmark residential tower envisioned to redefine contemporary living in Colombo 7.\n\nThe announcement comes as welcome news to clients and investors who have been awaiting Prime\u2019s next signature development within Colombo 7 following the strong market performance of Grand Ward Place. Demand for a comparable address within the district has remained consistently strong, with limited new supply entering the market.\n\nSet on approximately one acre in one of Colombo\u2019s most established residential enclaves, the Otters Club property represents one of the last remaining Prime development-ready land parcels within a tightly held district.\n\nUnder the agreement with the UDA, the proposed development will comprise a ground plus 23-storey residential tower. The historic Otters Club will be thoughtfully integrated within the 4th and 5th floors of the building while remaining fully independent and operational, preserving its members-only heritage while reinforcing the stature and cultural significance of the address.\n\nThe convergence of colonial architecture and contemporary residential design positions The Elizabeth as a future architectural landmark within Colombo 7.\n\nFollowing the delivery success and strong market reception of Grand Ward Place, The Elizabeth represents the company\u2019s next landmark development within Colombo 7."
  },
