    "description": "Advantis and Belgium-based Sarens to strengthen heavy lift and engineered transport capabilities",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/business/Advantis-and-Belgium-based-Sarens-to-strengthen-heavy-lift-and-engineered-transport-capabilities/34-788848",
